{
  "name": "EmitBuildEvent",
  "comment": "One-call helper for build-time output. Caller passes %event% (name) plus any\nvariables the template needs:\n- call EmitBuildEvent event=\"build-path\"                              (path is already in scope at the caller? still passes as goal param)\n- call EmitBuildEvent event=\"step-fresh\", step=%step%\n- call EmitBuildEvent event=\"build-error\", goal=%goal%, errorMessage=%!error.Message%\nRenders /system/builder/templates/output/build-output.template (one\ntemplate, one case-block per event) and writes the result to the \"builder\"\nchannel. Swap the channel's backing goal to redirect all build output.",
